# Copied to .env by `npm run setup`. .env is gitignored: put real keys only in .env, never in this file.
#
# The sample journey needs no keys. It runs against the public ParaBank site.
# /from-jira signs in through the Atlassian MCP inside Cursor, not through this file.
# Add your own keys below when a feature needs them.

# Optional: point Cypress at a different ParaBank deployment.
# Default: https://parabank.parasoft.com/parabank
# CYPRESS_BASE_URL=
